Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:55.85,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 费尔南德斯 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Please have your champion speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请冠军发表致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to congratulate Leylah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想祝贺莱拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:08.70,EN,,0,0,0,,with a great week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周她表现出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,A lot of tough matches, tough wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一路都是硬仗苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats to you and your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺你和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and good luck for the rest of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你今年余下赛季好运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先我要祝贺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的对手费尔南德斯在宁波
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,的比赛当中你打了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,很精彩也很艰难的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟你的团队在接下来剩余
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,的赛季继续有出色的发挥精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to say thank you to my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想感谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.10,EN,,0,0,0,,most of them back home watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们大多在家里看比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,supporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,为我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:38.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, guys, and thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们也要谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:41.58,EN,,0,0,0,,to Stas for staying with me this week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢斯塔斯这一周陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:43.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and supporting each match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一场都支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I would like to say thank you to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,who made this tournament possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这站比赛得以办成
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:52.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Laura, for always taking such good care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,劳拉谢谢你一直以来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:53.62,EN,,0,0,0,,of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我们的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Chair umpires, physios, ball boys, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,主裁理疗师球童和所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:58.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,太感谢大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时我要感谢我的团队很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,的成员其实是在家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,正在通过电视来看我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛感谢你们对我的支持当然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有在现场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的团队的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练对于我这一周的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:12.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要同时感谢赛事方我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,的赛事监督赛事总监两位赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,总监对于我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.02,0:01:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,精彩表现的付出同时要感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有为我们呈现那么多那么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,好美妙时刻宁波网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,的各位再次感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:32.54,EN,,0,0,0,,And of course, thank you to my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然要谢谢我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,friends, sponsors, and all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,朋友赞助商和你们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:40.84,EN,,0,0,0,,for an amazing atmosphere every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一天的氛围都太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.06,EN,,0,0,0,,It's amazing to play in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,在你们面前打球太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:44.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Always gives a lot of motivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,总能给我很多动力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of energy to keep on playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多继续打下去的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's already a second year here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我第二年来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:51.66,EN,,0,0,0,,second win, and it's such a special place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二次夺冠这里太特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:52.50,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much Ningbo, xie xie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,太感谢了宁波谢谢
